From: pmOS Q706F fixes
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8250-lenovo-q706f: mux SPI13 CS as GPIO

7.2 pinctrl refuses GPIO_39 when spi13's default pinctrl muxes it as
qup13 while cs-gpios also claims it. Probe then fails with -EINVAL and
the Goodix GT9916 SPI touchscreen never appears.

Keep cs-gpios and mux the CS pin as GPIO (qup_spi13_cs_gpio), matching
the unused state already in this DTS.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-lenovo-q706f.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-lenovo-q706f.dts
@@ -1262,7 +1262,7 @@
 &spi13 {
 	status = "okay";
 	pinctrl-names = "default";
-	pinctrl-0 = <&qup_spi13_data_clk>, <&qup_spi13_cs>;
+	pinctrl-0 = <&qup_spi13_data_clk>, <&qup_spi13_cs_gpio>;
 	cs-gpios = <&tlmm 39 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
 
 	touchscreen@0 {
